                                "sense_id": "d8b4eb9e-dd62-36a5-ae60-e431441ab01d",
                                "text": "Transformed deviants tend to become not merely moral but hypermoral. They are not simply \"reformed\" or \"rehabilitated\" into regular people with regular jobs and regular lives. They become extraregular people , have extraregular jobs ( even if the job is not the way they make a living ) , and live extraregular lives ."
